    "Design confirmed from photos 2026-10-10 (integrator review of the pilot: balconies are stacked in the centre, the pilot model put them in the outer bays). All 12 open-pilotis Comenius/Johan Huizingalaan members shown in the survey montage share it.",
    "Front bays (left to right as seen from outside), counted from 0363100012078925 (most frontal): 3 single punched windows per storey, balcony column, narrow stair strip with the drainpipe and the entrance below, balcony column, 2 single windows, blank end bay. Photos 0363100012143810 and 0363100012139456 show the same centre stack; the oblique crops cannot confirm the window count at the ends (inferred).",
    "Balconies are 1.35 m wide, project ~0.9 m, white bars balustrade with a French door behind; the strip between the two columns has no window (drainpipe and wall).",
    "Ground storey is always open pilotis: white columns ~3.4 m apart, storage doors set back 1.6 m, entrance flush behind the columns in the strip. Wall: light grey-beige aggregate panels (see palette).",
